16 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (A multi-panel figure displaying precipitation, mean temperature, wildfire smoke, carcasses collected, and carcasses collected for each age class and foraging guild from September 1st\20530th, 2020. A spike of precipitation, coinciding with a spike in carcasses collected and a drastic drop in daily mean temperature, occurs within the time frame of September 6th \205 12th and is highlighted in gray.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (A figure with bar-charts depicting the number of carcasses collected for each species with > 20 carcasses collected arranged in descending order from left to right.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 29 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
18 0 obj
<< /A 39 0 R /Alt (Two donut plots with the top plot depicting the proportion of necropsy results where cause of death was emaciation related, non-emaciation related, or unknown, and the bottom plot depicting fat score category \(low, moderate, high\) for live captured birds during the fall 2020 avian mortality event. A close relationship is seen between fat score category and necropsy results with low fat score and emaciation related cause of death having similar proportions.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
